<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Telekom up in early 2nd-day trade.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telekom up in early 2nd-day trade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG rose slightly in early trade on Germany's IBIS electronic bourse system, gaining 12 pfennigs on Monday's close to start at 32.70 marks on its second day of trade as a publicly-quoted stock.</p>
<p>Telekom shares closed at 33.90 in bourse trade on Monday after opening at 33.20 and touching a day-high of 34.10 marks.</p>
<p>The stock is due to take its place among the main DAX index of Germany's leading shares later on Tuesday, where it will be the 10th largest stock.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
